references/audits/methodological-audit_2026-04-30.md:38:**Evidence stratification.** Seven-tier hierarchy with Co-1 (lived experience) elevated to co-primary alongside Tier 1 OT clinical RCTs; codes demoted to Tier 6 floor. The explicit rejection of code-consensus as best practice is the most consequential single methodological move in the doctrine. The treatment of code minima as "informative where nothing else can be" rather than as gold standards is uncommon in the field.
